Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.36,0:01:56.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,No matter how hard I try to suppress them,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.28,0:01:59.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't completely eradicate the demonic thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.72,0:02:06.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems I need to find another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.48,0:02:09.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.72,0:02:13.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've been in this Demon Spirit Land for a few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.52,0:02:16.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The local customs
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.40,0:02:17.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,and cultivation methods
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.04,0:02:20.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,are completely different from the outside world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.64,0:02:23.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,But some of the carvings here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.08,0:02:27.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,are very similar to those of the ancient Celestial Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:31.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.28,0:02:34.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,that this place is the cultivation cave of a Celestial ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.48,0:02:37.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,If that's truly the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.48,0:02:39.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,then all living beings here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.92,0:02:41.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,are no different from livestock.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.60,0:02:45.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth show no mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.88,0:02:46.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whether it's here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.32,0:02:48.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,or in the outside world...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.68,0:02:50.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.72,0:02:52.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Customer,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.84,0:02:54.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,our shop's green bamboo wine
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.16,0:02:56.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,is renowned across the 9 countries !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:02:58.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Would you like to try a cup ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.24,0:03:02.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.28,0:03:07.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,How many years has it been
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.00,0:03:09.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,since I last drank wine ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.76,0:03:16.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since the Heng Yue Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.96,0:03:17.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,but we finally meet again !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.96,0:03:19.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come on, cheers !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.20,0:03:20.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Zhang Hu...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.28,0:03:31.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tie Zhu...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.20,0:03:37.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.80,0:03:39.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.56,0:03:45.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,No !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.68,0:03:57.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're looking for death !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.76,0:04:35.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.24,0:04:36.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.40,0:04:38.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.88,0:04:39.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.08,0:04:53.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,A single trace of demonic thoughts
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.80,0:04:56.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,actually caused my mind to lose control.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.76,0:04:59.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I don't get rid of it now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.72,0:05:01.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I won't be able to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.28,0:05:04.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,But suppressing it with celestial spiritual energy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.20,0:05:06.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,isn't very effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.84,0:05:11.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, please come inside !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.48,0:05:14.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bring us your best dishes
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.04,0:05:15.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,and your best wine !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.12,0:05:16.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Faster than that !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.44,0:05:19.08,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1412,628)}Sima Yan\NBlack Armor Army Vice-Commander\NRank 100 000 demonic energy\N(Early stage Soul Transformation)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.88,0:05:21.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,You bystanders
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.12,0:05:22.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,can scram !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.64,0:05:26.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.60,0:05:33.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Commander can rest assured !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.12,0:05:34.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if that man dares to come take his post,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.92,0:05:36.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Black Armor Army won't acknowledge him !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.16,0:05:38.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Have you found out his background ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.36,0:05:39.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Commander,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.44,0:05:41.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,he's an outsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:44.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,He couldn't even withstand the Demon General's Ten Collapse Battle Intent
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.76,0:05:47.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,but he was still granted the position of Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.56,0:05:52.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,You earned your Commander position through your own military merits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.12,0:05:53.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,It makes no sense for you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.56,0:05:54.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,to be demoted because of this guy !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.64,0:05:56.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:05:57.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,An outsider ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.68,0:06:02.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Someone weaker than me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.64,0:06:04.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,is unworthy of commanding me !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.28,0:06:14.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,You clueless fools...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.00,0:06:15.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Scram now !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.04,0:06:16.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,How dare you !?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.24,0:06:19.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare disrespect the Ancestor !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.48,0:06:20.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bold of you !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.56,0:06:22.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're looking for death !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.20,0:06:24.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Get them !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.92,0:06:47.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,This person is quite peculiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.48,0:06:51.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are 2 completely different forces battling within him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.16,0:07:02.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,You savages...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.00,0:07:04.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,How dare you cause trouble in Ancient Demon City !?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.52,0:07:09.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.20,0:07:18.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,The celestial and demonic energies within me are at a stalemate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.00,0:07:20.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't break out of this state.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.00,0:07:22.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Perhaps an external stimulus can help me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.80,0:07:26.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's happening !?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.88,0:07:28.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't control my spear !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.68,0:07:29.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could he be...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.40,0:07:31.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,absorbing demonic energy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.48,0:07:33.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Withdraw demonic energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.56,0:07:34.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,quick !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.28,0:07:54.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.96,0:07:56.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor, you're awake !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.36,0:07:59.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.72,0:08:01.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Ancestor !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.28,0:08:13.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop here !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.68,0:08:21.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,We will meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.80,0:08:33.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,The celestial and demonic energies are incompatible,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.28,0:08:35.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,making it hard to expel the demonic thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.36,0:08:39.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,But by using the demonic energy outside my body, I was able to drive it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.08,0:08:42.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I managed to get out of this situation by a fluke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.60,0:08:46.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,These demonic thoughts can corrupt Dao Hearts,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.44,0:08:47.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,they're impossible to guard against.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.08,0:08:49.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll refine and keep them for later,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.12,0:08:51.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I might find a use for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.72,0:08:52.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.68,0:08:53.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,someone requests an audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.04,0:08:54.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.72,0:09:03.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am Han Jin, military advisor of Ancient Demon City.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.00,0:09:05.00,Card Hard,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(411,521)}Han Jin\NAncient Demon City's military advisor
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.16,0:09:05.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,By order of the Demon General,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.08,0:09:08.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm here to escort Commander Wang to his assigned barracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.80,0:09:11.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,He doesn't display his aura,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.16,0:09:14.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't quite see through his cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.88,0:09:16.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please show me your Commander token.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.12,0:09:22.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Commander Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.92,0:09:23.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.88,0:09:34.08,Card Hard,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(350,479)}Black Armor Barracks\NAncient Demon City
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.96,0:09:56.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where is Sima Yan ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.68,0:10:18.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,By order of the Demon General,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.48,0:10:21.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I escort the newly appointed Commander Wang Lin to assume his post.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.72,0:10:22.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vice-Commander Sima,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.12,0:10:24.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,pay your respects.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.16,0:10:27.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sima Yan pays his respects to Commander Wang.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.68,0:10:28.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've already met.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.52,0:10:31.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you two know each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.04,0:10:33.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't disturb you any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.84,0:10:35.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will take my leave
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.60,0:10:36.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,to report back to the Demon General.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.52,0:10:39.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.12,0:10:42.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Commander Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.76,0:10:44.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,the 10 000 soldiers of the Black Armor Army,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.08,0:10:47.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,except for 3 who are unconscious,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.56,0:10:48.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,are all present.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.88,0:10:52.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of you are dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.28,0:11:04.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.48,0:11:05.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understood !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.08,0:11:18.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where did this coward come from ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.60,0:11:20.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,How dare he think he can command us ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.48,0:11:22.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,He should get the hell out of here !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.12,0:11:26.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I, Sima Yan, am the only Commander of the Black Armor Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.76,0:11:30.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's see how long you can last.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.44,0:11:33.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the Commander's tent,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.68,0:11:34.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,how dare you block the way ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.84,0:11:36.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is Commander Sima's tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.08,0:11:40.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,No trespassing is allowed !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.96,0:11:44.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Might I ask where the Vice-Commander's tent is ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.68,0:11:53.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is too much...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.20,0:11:54.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.00,0:11:56.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,since they're acting like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.28,0:11:57.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,we should teach them a lesson !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.36,0:12:04.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Have you two memorized
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.24,0:12:07.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Sky Demon Country's Military Law ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.72,0:12:11.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,We will memorize it right away !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.80,0:12:13.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,If a soldier defies orders,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.52,0:12:14.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's that soldier's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.72,0:12:16.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,If 10 000 defy orders,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.80,0:12:19.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's the Commander's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.68,0:12:22.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I act rashly, it will give them an excuse
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.52,0:12:25.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I will only lose my position as Commander
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.84,0:12:27.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,and end up wanted throughout the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.52,0:12:31.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Establishing authority
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.56,0:12:32.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,takes time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.36,0:12:40.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,He hasn't done anything for several days now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.04,0:12:42.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,What exactly is he planning ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.20,0:12:49.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do you think this Wang Lin
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.60,0:12:52.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,is actually scheming ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.36,0:12:54.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's pathetic,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.16,0:12:57.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,he's just a worthless fool waiting to be slaughtered.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.52,0:12:58.44,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1514,603)}Sun Xiao\NBlack Armor Army Regiment Leader\NRank 10 000 demonic energy\N(Nascent Soul)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.48,0:13:00.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Regiment Leader Sun, I disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.48,0:13:03.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,This man remains completely unperturbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.24,0:13:05.40,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1535,608)\fad(300,000)}Yuan Shan\NBlack Armor Army Regiment Leader\NRank 10 000 demonic energy\N(Nascent Soul)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.88,0:13:05.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid he is no ordinary person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.12,0:13:06.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Old man Yuan,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.76,0:13:10.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,that man unjustly took Commander Sima's position.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.52,0:13:13.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,We were all nurtured by the Commander himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.48,0:13:16.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't diminish your own prestige
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.16,0:13:18.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,or try to drag us down with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.04,0:13:19.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,You !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.76,0:13:20.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Enough !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.08,0:13:27.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Commander Sima is probably doing this out of respect for the Demon General.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.08,0:13:30.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,He can't openly do anything against that Wang fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.68,0:13:33.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,But this Wang Lin is just a coward,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.08,0:13:35.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,what is there to fear ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.96,0:13:40.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I can get rid of him for Commander Sima,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.52,0:13:43.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,he will surely reward me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.88,0:13:50.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Commander Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.96,0:13:54.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I heard you have a broad mind
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.56,0:13:55.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,and are very tolerant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.72,0:14:04.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,He really doesn't care ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.16,0:14:05.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's simply...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.08,0:14:06.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,trash !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.16,0:14:09.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Regiment Leader Sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.36,0:14:10.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,what did you just say ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.60,0:14:11.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I said you're tra...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.36,0:14:14.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Release the Regiment Leader !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.84,0:14:18.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sky Demon Country's Military Law, Article 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.52,0:14:20.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Recite it !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.28,0:14:22.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those who revolt
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.68,0:14:23.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,against their superior shall be...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.88,0:14:24.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,beheaded !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.28,0:14:25.03,Second,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.84,0:14:36.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Avenge the Regiment Leader !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.08,0:14:43.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stubborn fools...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.88,0:14:49.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.92,0:14:52.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,How dare you harm my demon soldiers !?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.48,0:14:53.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is outrageous !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.88,0:14:54.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Commander !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.68,0:14:56.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Commander is here to settle this matter !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.56,0:15:17.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you also wish
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.56,0:15:20.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,to revolt against your superior ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.68,0:15:24.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.80,0:15:27.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,you killed a Regiment Leader and slaughtered demon soldiers !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.40,0:15:29.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,We will not let this matter slide !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.12,0:15:30.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thirteen,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.28,0:15:33.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sky Demon Country's Military Law, Article 13.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.12,0:15:35.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those who participate in a mutiny
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.68,0:15:37.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,have 10 breaths to disperse or shall be
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.20,0:15:37.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,beheaded !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.84,0:15:39.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Start counting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.40,0:15:40.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,10
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.28,0:15:42.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,9
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.28,0:15:44.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,8
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.48,0:15:46.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,7
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.32,0:15:48.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,6
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.28,0:15:50.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,5
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.88,0:15:52.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,4
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.64,0:15:54.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,3
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.40,0:15:56.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,2
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.08,0:15:57.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disperse !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.00,0:16:04.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't think you've won.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.40,0:16:10.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vice-Commander Sima,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.36,0:16:13.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,what urgent matter
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:15.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,did you summon me for ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.00,0:16:17.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Commander Wang unjustly killed a Regiment Leader
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.80,0:16:19.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,and slaughtered demon soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.56,0:16:21.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I had no choice but to summon you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.32,0:16:23.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,to enforce the Military Law !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.92,0:16:27.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such a vicious slander.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.56,0:16:30.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are there any witnesses ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.92,0:16:32.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin's methods are cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.80,0:16:34.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,The entire Black Armor Army
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.08,0:16:36.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,are witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.08,0:16:40.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thirteen...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.52,0:16:45.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,The entire sequence of events
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.72,0:16:47.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,is recorded in this jade.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.72,0:16:54.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,You think before acting,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.28,0:16:57.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Commander Wang really is skilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.84,0:16:59.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those who revolted against their superior
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.80,0:17:00.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,deserved to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.88,0:17:04.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will now report this matter to the Demon General.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.44,0:17:10.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I, with 100 000 rank of demonic energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.28,0:17:12.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,a Commander of the army,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.40,0:17:16.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,have actually been trampled by an outsider !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.04,0:17:22.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vice-Commander Sima,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.20,0:17:24.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,commanding an army
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.52,0:17:26.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,lies in being impartial, fair,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.28,0:17:28.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,and ensuring orders are followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.24,0:17:29.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not in fighting amongst ourselves
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.08,0:17:31.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,or trying to be brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.00,0:17:33.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,You'd better remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.88,0:17:37.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,This subordinate was reckless...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.00,0:17:40.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I beg Commander Wang's forgiveness !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.52,0:17:42.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,You are not qualified
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.48,0:17:44.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,to be my enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.88,0:17:47.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,We pay respects to the Commander !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.08,0:17:49.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,We pay respects to the Commander !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.04,0:17:51.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,We pay respects to the Commander !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.68,0:18:06.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of you are dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.88,0:18:07.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understood !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.16,0:18:12.32,Card Hard,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1539,459)}Third Army Barracks\NAncient Demon City
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.96,0:18:18.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I failed again...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.96,0:18:21.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for the Blood Soul Pills,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.56,0:18:24.48,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1602,477)\fad(300,300)}Blood Soul Pills
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.16,0:18:23.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would have died 4 times already...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.20,0:18:29.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't have many chances left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.52,0:18:30.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must not fail in the task
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.76,0:18:33.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,that Father gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.12,0:18:38.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,If only I knew someone skilled in restrictions to help me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.12,0:18:41.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I would succeed in a single try.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.68,0:19:00.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}I've been walking this path for endless years
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.98,0:19:00.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.96,0:19:05.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}Is it the compass of fate
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.80,0:19:05.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}that wrote this outcome for us ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.08,0:19:11.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}The heavens want to erase your existence,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.96,0:19:17.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}that's the obsession guiding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.84,0:19:23.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}Is this the path to uncover
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.72,0:19:23.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}truths from falsehoods ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.44,0:19:28.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}In a world of murk and shadow,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.34,0:19:28.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}only the flame of truth can light the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.80,0:19:34.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Look at them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.68,0:19:34.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}being carried by the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.92,0:19:39.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Look at them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.08,0:19:39.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}being drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.20,0:19:42.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.48,0:19:45.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,300)}I will let the world refine my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.65,0:19:51.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.34,0:19:51.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}I will fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.08,0:19:54.20,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}I'll break through the abyss of despair
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.20,0:19:57.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}to finally learn who I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.24,0:20:02.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)}My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.12,0:20:02.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,300)}I embrace this obsession.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.60,0:20:05.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)}I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.56,0:20:08.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)}Even if this suffering shatters my soul
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.36,0:20:13.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,700)}and I'm reborn countless times in hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.40,0:20:13.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1500,700)}I'll still fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.04,0:20:17.20,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}It's hard to avoid loneliness
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.20,0:20:20.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}when you are above everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.24,0:20:25.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.56,0:20:25.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}be afraid of a firefly ?
